# autotune: the fine-tuning assistant (issue #100) on the real main screen.
# The APP key loads buttons_group_app (src/main_screen.c, KEYPAD_APP), the page
# button cycles to page 6 and the "Auto Tune" button (src/buttons.cpp,
# make_action_btn("Auto\nTune", ACTION_ATUNE)) is pressed, which reaches
# main_screen_action(ACTION_ATUNE) -> autotune_ui_toggle() -> the scan starts.
#
# The harness drives the scan to completion on its virtual clock
# (src/screens.c, scenario_settle). The S-meter the bank feeds is constant
# (mock_radio.smeter_db), so no probe beats the start and the scan restores the
# dial: the capture is the start frequency, never lost. The real "which spot
# sounds better" correlation is the owner's radio (docs/autotune.md).
#
# The radio state matches home-usb-20m / apps-menu-6, so the only difference is
# the running assistant.

name autotune
screen autotune

seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
